			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): null-guard Configuration.Inspect response + ESM ModuleInterceptor\n\nWorkspaceNamespace: Mountain returns null for unknown config keys (e.g.\nemmet.useInlineCompletions). Casting null as Record<string,unknown> then\naccessing .workspaceFolderValue throws TypeError and crashes Cocoon at\n~5s uptime. Fix with optional chaining so null falls through to Value.\n\nModuleInterceptor: CocoonMain.js is an ESM bundle — require() is not in\nscope. Effect.try(() => require(\"module\")) threw UnknownException, leaving\nthe Module._load hook uninstalled. Fix by using Effect.tryPromise with\ndynamic import(\"node:module\") which is valid in ESM context.\n\nGenerated-By: PostHog Code\nTask-Id: 4b683d18-b7f2-47a0-814e-6cff7f6e0e2e",
			"SHA": "7322350abdd3e29ee21b3ecaea15b9e6f4c93d75"
