				604,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Improve extension exports stub and fix storage path\n\n- Rename performance-benchmark.js to PerformanceBenchmark.js (PascalCase naming)\n- Change extension storage path from `~/.codeeditorland/extensions/storage` to `~/.codeeditorland/extensionStorage` to avoid Mountain scanner warnings\n- Enhance MakePermissiveExports with a multi-stub that handles all VS Code extension idioms: callable, iterable (Symbol.iterator yields empty), and chainable (any property returns same stub)\n- Delegate array methods to empty array so `.map`, `.filter`, `.forEach` etc. work without throwing\n- Properly handle well-known symbols for iterable exports objects\n\nThis ensures extension API access patterns like `gitAPI.repositories`, `for (...of gitAPI.repositories)`, and `gitAPI.getAPI(1).registerX()` work without activation failures.",
			"SHA": "905403b1315343717b7bfc4eddb046fa009cffa8"
		}
